{
    "title": "Popsa | Print Your Photos",
    "description": "<b>Turn your favorite photos into beautiful photobooks with Popsa, the world's fastest photobook app.</b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 Each order takes just 5 MINUTES on average\r\n\u2022 Print up to 600 photos\r\n\u2022 Across up to 150 pages\r\n\u2022 Prices start from just $12\r\n\r\nDownload today to get 20% off your first order, with voucher code: WELCOME\r\n\r\n__________\r\n\r\nINSTANT LAYOUTS\r\n\r\nPopsa does the fiddly bits for you \u2013 instantly.\r\n\r\nOnce you\u2019ve picked your photos, our super-fast app creates your layout automatically. It does it all:\r\n\u2022 Picks the perfect template\r\n\u2022 Crops your pictures\r\n\u2022 Groups similar pictures together\r\n\u2022 Chooses the best colour scheme\r\n\r\n__________\r\n\r\nFRAMED PHOTO TILES\r\n\r\nCreate your own stickable photo tiles in seconds with Popsa.\r\n\r\n\u2022 No nails required! Our picture tiles come with adhesive backs for your walls\r\n\u2022 All of our photo tiles come ready-framed in high-quality black or white frames\r\n\u2022 Stick and restick as many times as you like\r\n\u2022 Mix and match \u2013 our photo tiles look great in groups\r\n\u2022 Add captions to your tiles (if you like!)\r\n\u2022 Made from an eco-friendly mix of 50% recycled polymers\r\n\r\n__________\r\n\r\nCUSTOM CALENDARS\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s easy to make your own calendars with Popsa, too.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Our photo calendars come on 250gsm paper stock as standard\r\n\u2022 That\u2019s seriously high quality paper \u2013 thicker than our photobooks! \u2013 and it makes every calendar feel special\r\n\u2022 Our photo calendars come uncoated, making them easy to scribble on\r\n\u2022 Your personalized calendar can cover any 12-month period. Whether it\u2019s a late 2020 calendar that stretches into 2021, or a brand new 2021 calendar, you can make them all with Popsa.\r\n\r\n__________\r\n\r\nAND THERE\u2019S MORE\r\n\r\nPopsa has even more ways to enjoy your photos.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Create high-quality, individual photo prints\r\n\u2022 7 sizes available\r\n\u2022 Choose from matte or gloss\r\n\u2022 Or turn your photos into Christmas ornaments!\r\n\u2022\u00a0Made from high-quality, polished acrylic\r\n\r\n__________\r\n\r\nALL YOUR PHOTOS IN ONE PLACE\r\n\r\nWith Popsa, you can use photos from:\r\n\u2022 Your phone\r\n\u2022 Facebook\r\n\u2022 Instagram\r\n\u2022 Google Photos\r\n\u2022 Dropbox\r\n\r\nNo more messing around with lots of different apps and accounts \u2013 with Popsa, it\u2019s all under one roof.\r\n\r\nAnd with Google Photos, you can even search for specific images using keywords. \u2018Greece 2020\u2019. \u2018Ginger kitten\u2019. \u2018Mum and Dad\u2019.\r\n\r\n__________\r\n\r\nPERFECT GIFTS\r\n\r\nPopsa photobooks and photo prints are thoughtful, personalized gifts for friends and family. And the best part? You did the hard work when you took the pictures! \r\n\r\nJust select your favorite memories:\r\n\u2022 Wedding snaps\r\n\u2022 Baby pictures\r\n\u2022 Family holidays\r\n\u2022 Birthday photos\r\n\u2022 Pet pics\r\n\u2022 ...It\u2019s completely up to you\r\n\r\nAnd for the finishing touch, we can even gift box your photobook or ornaments for you. Just select the option at checkout.\r\n\r\nNOTE: We don\u2019t include receipts with your delivery, so if it\u2019s a gift, you can ship your photo album directly to the recipient.\r\n\r\n__________\r\n\r\nQUALITY PRINTING\r\n\r\nOur state-of-the-art printers are renowned for their high quality standards.\r\n\r\nChoose from:\r\n\r\nSoftcover Photobook \r\n\u2022 200gsm paper\r\n\u2022 Medium and Large sizes\r\n\u2022 Matte or Gloss paper\r\n\u2022 20-150 pages\r\n\u2022 From $18\r\n\r\nHardback Photobook\r\n\u2022 200gsm luxury paper\r\n\u2022 Medium, Large and Extra Large sizes\r\n\u2022 Matte or Gloss paper\r\n\u2022 20-150 pages\r\n\u2022 From $24\r\n\r\nPhotobooklet\r\n\u2022 200gsm paper\r\n\u2022 12-20 pages\r\n\u2022 From $12\r\n\r\n__________\r\n\r\nAPP FEATURES\r\n\r\n\u2022 Create a photobook in just 5 minutes\r\n\u2022 Add captions to every page\r\n\u2022 (And emojis, too!)\r\n\u2022 See your book in 3D before you order\r\n\u2022 Choose from a wide range of templates \r\n\u2022 And hundreds of themes\r\n\u2022 Drag and drop photos in seconds\r\n\u2022 Pay in your preferred currency\r\n\u2022 Receive voucher-code discounts\r\n\u2022 Save your delivery addresses for future use\r\n\u2022 Pay with Google Pay\r\n\u2022 Securely store your card details for 1-tap payments\r\n\u2022 Track your order seamlessly\r\n\r\n__________\r\n\r\nSUPPORT\r\n\r\nWe have a great support team on standby to help you out in the unlikely event that something goes wrong. Contact support@popsa.com and we\u2019ll be with you as soon as possible.\r\n\r\nHappy printing!\r\n\r\nPopsa\r\n\r\n__________\r\n\r\nOrders are currently being dispatched as normal.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Turn your favorite photos into beautiful photobooks with Popsa, the world&#39;s fastest photobook app.</b><br><br>\u2022 Each order takes just 5 MINUTES on average<br>\u2022 Print up to 600 photos<br>\u2022 Across up to 150 pages<br>\u2022 Prices start from just $12<br><br>Download today to get 20% off your first order, with voucher code: WELCOME<br><br>__________<br><br>INSTANT LAYOUTS<br><br>Popsa does the fiddly bits for you \u2013 instantly.<br><br>Once you\u2019ve picked your photos, our super-fast app creates your layout automatically. It does it all:<br>\u2022 Picks the perfect template<br>\u2022 Crops your pictures<br>\u2022 Groups similar pictures together<br>\u2022 Chooses the best colour scheme<br><br>__________<br><br>FRAMED PHOTO TILES<br><br>Create your own stickable photo tiles in seconds with Popsa.<br><br>\u2022 No nails required! Our picture tiles come with adhesive backs for your walls<br>\u2022 All of our photo tiles come ready-framed in high-quality black or white frames<br>\u2022 Stick and restick as many times as you like<br>\u2022 Mix and match \u2013 our photo tiles look great in groups<br>\u2022 Add captions to your tiles (if you like!)<br>\u2022 Made from an eco-friendly mix of 50% recycled polymers<br><br>__________<br><br>CUSTOM CALENDARS<br><br>It\u2019s easy to make your own calendars with Popsa, too.<br><br>\u2022 Our photo calendars come on 250gsm paper stock as standard<br>\u2022 That\u2019s seriously high quality paper \u2013 thicker than our photobooks! \u2013 and it makes every calendar feel special<br>\u2022 Our photo calendars come uncoated, making them easy to scribble on<br>\u2022 Your personalized calendar can cover any 12-month period. Whether it\u2019s a late 2020 calendar that stretches into 2021, or a brand new 2021 calendar, you can make them all with Popsa.<br><br>__________<br><br>AND THERE\u2019S MORE<br><br>Popsa has even more ways to enjoy your photos.<br><br>\u2022 Create high-quality, individual photo prints<br>\u2022 7 sizes available<br>\u2022 Choose from matte or gloss<br>\u2022 Or turn your photos into Christmas ornaments!<br>\u2022\u00a0Made from high-quality, polished acrylic<br><br>__________<br><br>ALL YOUR PHOTOS IN ONE PLACE<br><br>With Popsa, you can use photos from:<br>\u2022 Your phone<br>\u2022 Facebook<br>\u2022 Instagram<br>\u2022 Google Photos<br>\u2022 Dropbox<br><br>No more messing around with lots of different apps and accounts \u2013 with Popsa, it\u2019s all under one roof.<br><br>And with Google Photos, you can even search for specific images using keywords. \u2018Greece 2020\u2019. \u2018Ginger kitten\u2019. \u2018Mum and Dad\u2019.<br><br>__________<br><br>PERFECT GIFTS<br><br>Popsa photobooks and photo prints are thoughtful, personalized gifts for friends and family. And the best part? You did the hard work when you took the pictures! <br><br>Just select your favorite memories:<br>\u2022 Wedding snaps<br>\u2022 Baby pictures<br>\u2022 Family holidays<br>\u2022 Birthday photos<br>\u2022 Pet pics<br>\u2022 ...It\u2019s completely up to you<br><br>And for the finishing touch, we can even gift box your photobook or ornaments for you. Just select the option at checkout.<br><br>NOTE: We don\u2019t include receipts with your delivery, so if it\u2019s a gift, you can ship your photo album directly to the recipient.<br><br>__________<br><br>QUALITY PRINTING<br><br>Our state-of-the-art printers are renowned for their high quality standards.<br><br>Choose from:<br><br>Softcover Photobook <br>\u2022 200gsm paper<br>\u2022 Medium and Large sizes<br>\u2022 Matte or Gloss paper<br>\u2022 20-150 pages<br>\u2022 From $18<br><br>Hardback Photobook<br>\u2022 200gsm luxury paper<br>\u2022 Medium, Large and Extra Large sizes<br>\u2022 Matte or Gloss paper<br>\u2022 20-150 pages<br>\u2022 From $24<br><br>Photobooklet<br>\u2022 200gsm paper<br>\u2022 12-20 pages<br>\u2022 From $12<br><br>__________<br><br>APP FEATURES<br><br>\u2022 Create a photobook in just 5 minutes<br>\u2022 Add captions to every page<br>\u2022 (And emojis, too!)<br>\u2022 See your book in 3D before you order<br>\u2022 Choose from a wide range of templates <br>\u2022 And hundreds of themes<br>\u2022 Drag and drop photos in seconds<br>\u2022 Pay in your preferred currency<br>\u2022 Receive voucher-code discounts<br>\u2022 Save your delivery addresses for future use<br>\u2022 Pay with Google Pay<br>\u2022 Securely store your card details for 1-tap payments<br>\u2022 Track your order seamlessly<br><br>__________<br><br>SUPPORT<br><br>We have a great support team on standby to help you out in the unlikely event that something goes wrong. Contact support@popsa.com and we\u2019ll be with you as soon as possible.<br><br>Happy printing!<br><br>Popsa<br><br>__________<br><br>Orders are currently being dispatched as normal.",
